    "description": "Designer renovated 2 lvl 3BDR/2BA home in prime Bernal location - 1 blk north of Cortland's village + 95 WalkScore! Newly renovated, pro kitchen w quartz island/breakfast bar, custom quartz counters & backsplash, stainless Miele gas range, custom plaster vent hood, Kohler sink, GE fridge, Miele dishwasher, quartz floating shelves, and custom cabinetry. Spacious dining area opens to the kitchen and living and bar area w built-in Zephyr wine fridge  perfect for entertaining! A bright BDR, a sleek, tiled laundry rm, and a beautiful, designer reno'd, tiled full bath. Up the skylit staircase, 2 spacious BDRs. The sumptuous primary BDR w soaring custom wood ceiling, a walk-in closet, and ample space for a king size bed. Another spacious BDR, and a huge tiled family BA, w a luxe multi person Grohe rain shower, and a built in tile bench. Private, sun-drenched, covered solarium - perfect for morning coffee. Pro designed resort - style backyard w custom pavers, turf lawn, designer lighting, and a gas firepit. Huge garage w SUV parking, storage space for home gym. Twin peaks views. Structural plumbing and electrical updates. Replaced sewer lateral. Nest & Google smart home. Quiet cul de sac. 1 blk to Pinhole and the village. Wow!"
  },
